 "prompt": "The repository at /testbed has a bug, described below. Fix it by changing the source code; do not modify or\nadd tests. When you are done, the project's existing test suite should pass.\n\n<issue>\nLine spacing rule setting broken for certain WD_LINE_SPACING values\n\n#### Description\n\nWhen setting `line_spacing_rule` to certain `WD_LINE_SPACING` values, the paragraph format doesn't get configured correctly. The spacing line value gets set incorrectly for some line spacing rules.\n\n#### Steps/Code to Reproduce\n\n```python\nfrom docx import Document\nfrom docx.enum.text import WD_LINE_SPACING\n\ndoc = Document()\nparagraph = doc.add_paragraph(\"Test paragraph\")\n\n# This should work correctly but doesn't\nparagraph.paragraph_format.line_spacing_rule = WD_LINE_SPACING.DOUBLE\n\n# Check the resulting XML - it will show incorrect spacing configuration\nprint(paragraph.paragraph_format._element.xml)\n```\n\nThe issue affects multiple `WD_LINE_SPACING` enum values where the spacing line and line rule attributes are not being set as expected in the underlying XML structure.\n</issue>\n",
